@host = http://localhost:5080

# Lưu ý:
# - Mọi lỗi trả ProblemDetails có "code" (vd. INVALID_CREDENTIALS, QUIZ_NOT_FOUND) – xem API_CHANGES.md.
# - login/register bị giới hạn 5 request/phút/IP (429 RATE_LIMITED); trial 10 request/giờ/IP.
# - Các danh sách trả PagedResult { items, page, pageSize, total }; query page, pageSize (≤ 50), sort.

### UC01 - Register Account
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "learner01",
  "email": "learner01@example.com",
  "password": "Learner@123"
}

### UC02 - Login (User)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "hoanganh",
  "password": "User@123"
}

### UC02 - Login (Administrator)
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usernameOrEmail": "admin",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.token}}
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### UC03 - Logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### UC04/UC05 - Browse / Search Public Quizzes (Guest)
GET {{host}}/api/quizzes?search=angular&page=1&pageSize=20&sort=newest

### UC06 - View Quiz Details (Guest)
GET {{host}}/api/quizzes/1

### UC11 - Create Quiz (User)
# @name createQuiz
POST {{host}}/api/quizzes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "C# Basics",
  "description": "Kiểm tra kiến thức C# cơ bản.",
  "duration": 20
}

@quizId = {{createQuiz.response.body.quizId}}

### UC12 - My Quizzes (phân trang, sort = newest | oldest | title)
GET {{host}}/api/quizzes/mine?page=1&pageSize=20&sort=title
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### UC12 - Update Quiz
PUT {{host}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "C# Basics (updated)",
  "description": "Kiểm tra kiến thức C# cơ bản.",
  "duration": 25
}

### UC15 - Create Question Bank
# @name createBank
POST {{host}}/api/question-banks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "C# Bank",
  "description": "Câu hỏi C# của tôi.",
  "isPublic": true
}

@bankId = {{createBank.response.body.questionBankId}}

### UC15 - Add Question (with answers) to Question Bank
# @name addBankQuestion
POST {{host}}/api/question-banks/{{bankId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Which keyword defines a constant in C#?",
  "questionType": "SingleChoice",
  "answers": [
    { "content": "const", "isCorrect": true },
    { "content": "static", "isCorrect": false },
    { "content": "readonly", "isCorrect": false }
  ]
}

@bankQuestionId = {{addBankQuestion.response.body.questionId}}

### UC13/UC17 - Reuse an existing Question into the Quiz
POST {{host}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionId": {{bankQuestionId}}
}

### UC13 - Add a brand-new Question directly into the Quiz
POST {{host}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionBankId": {{bankId}},
  "newQuestion": {
    "content": "C# runs only on Windows.",
    "questionType": "TrueFalse",
    "answers": [
      { "content": "True", "isCorrect": false },
      { "content": "False", "isCorrect": true }
    ]
  }
}

### UC16 - Search Public Questions
GET {{host}}/api/question-banks/public-questions?search=const

### UC14 - Publish Quiz
PUT {{host}}/api/quizzes/{{quizId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publish": true
}

### UC07 - Try Trial Quiz (Guest)
# @name startTrial
POST {{host}}/api/quizzes/1/trial
X-Guest-Id: guest-demo-0001

@trialAttemptId = {{startTrial.response.body.attemptId}}

### UC09 - Submit Quiz (trial)
POST {{host}}/api/attempts/{{trialAttemptId}}/submit
X-Guest-Id: guest-demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "answerId": 1 }
  ]
}

### UC10 - View Quiz Result (trial)
GET {{host}}/api/attempts/{{trialAttemptId}}/result
X-Guest-Id: guest-demo-0001

### UC08 - Take Quiz (User)
# @name startAttempt
POST {{host}}/api/quizzes/1/attempts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@attemptId = {{startAttempt.response.body.attemptId}}

### UC09 - Submit Quiz (User)
POST {{host}}/api/attempts/{{attemptId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    { "questionId": 1, "answerId": 1 }
  ]
}

### UC10 - View Quiz Result (User)
GET {{host}}/api/attempts/{{attemptId}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### UC08 - Lấy lại nội dung bài đang làm (reload trang) – có startedAt/expiresAt; đã nộp -> 409 ATTEMPT_SUBMITTED
GET {{host}}/api/attempts/{{attemptId}}/content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A5 - Bài đã làm (lịch sử, chỉ lượt đã nộp)
GET {{host}}/api/attempts/mine?page=1&pageSize=20&sort=newest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A5 - Danh sách câu tự luận chờ chấm của Quiz (chủ Quiz/Admin); includeGraded=true để lấy cả câu đã chấm
# @name grading
GET {{host}}/api/quizzes/1/grading?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@attemptAnswerId = {{grading.response.body.items[0].attemptAnswerId}}

### A5 - Chấm 1 câu tự luận -> trả điểm mới của lượt làm bài
PUT {{host}}/api/attempt-answers/{{attemptAnswerId}}/grade
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCorrect": true
}

### A5 - Thống kê Quiz (chủ Quiz/Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/quizzes/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### UC18 - Manage Users (Admin) – sort = newest | oldest | username
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users?search=&page=1&pageSize=20&sort=username
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### UC19 - Manage System Quizzes (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/quizzes?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### UC20 - Moderate Content: remove a Quiz (Admin)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/quizzes/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Removed"
}

### UC20 - Danh sách câu hỏi để kiểm duyệt (Admin) – search theo nội dung, status = Active | Removed
GET {{host}}/api/admin/questions?search=Angular&status=Active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### UC20 - Moderate Content: gỡ 1 Question (Admin) – câu bị gỡ biến mất khỏi quiz khi làm bài
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/questions/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Removed"
}

### (Kiểm tra lỗi 1) Guest xem bank công khai -> KHÔNG còn thấy isCorrect
GET {{host}}/api/question-banks/1/questions
